#DESCRIPTION
Wave injection (shear Alfven with flowing kinetic inflow): a By wave plus
matching electric field and Walen velocity kick is injected at the -x
wave+inflow face into a flowing magnetized hybrid plasma and propagates along +x
toward the absorbing/outflow +x boundary.

